/-
# N235 — THE g₂-INVARIANT FORMS δ, φ, ψ ARE g₂-INVARIANT (the generator toolkit for the FFT ascent)

DISSOLUTION-TOOLKIT node for N234's genuine W1 wall (irreducibility of the 27, `tracelessSym`).
N234 MEASURED that the two banked levers closing the other three atoms of `7 ⊗ 7 = 1 ⊕ 7 ⊕ 14 ⊕ 27`
(the so(n) dimension-bound and the prime-collapse) BOTH provably die on `27 = 3³`, and REFRAMED the
irreducibility to the g₂ INVARIANT-THEORY endomorphism count `dim (ImO^{⊗4})^{g₂} = dim End_{g₂}(7⊗7)
= 4`, which with N233's four DISTINCT-dimension summands forces `Σ mᵢ² = 4` over ≥4 terms ⟹ four
multiplicity-one irreducibles ⟹ the 27 irreducible. That count is the g₂ First Fundamental Theorem
of invariant theory, whose GENERATORS are exactly two DERIVED trunk objects:
  • the metric  δ = `gForm`  (the Born self-overlap, N24), and
  • the associative 3-form  φ = `assoc3`  (the imaginary octonion product, N209) — the SAME
    non-associativity object that stops the cascade / IS the gather obstruction,
together with its Hodge dual ψ = `coassoc4` (the coassociative 4-form, N210).

THE MISSING STRUCTURAL FACT the FFT count needs, and the SMALLEST forward step of it, is that these
generators actually LIE in the g₂-invariant space — i.e. that δ, φ, ψ are g₂-INVARIANT forms:

      δ:  ⟨D x, y⟩ + ⟨x, D y⟩ = 0                                    (bornForm_g2_invariant)
      φ:  φ(D x, y, z) + φ(x, D y, z) + φ(x, y, D z) = 0             (assoc3_g2_invariant)
      ψ:  ψ(D x,y,z,w)+ψ(x,D y,z,w)+ψ(x,y,D z,w)+ψ(x,y,z,D w) = 0    (coassoc4_g2_invariant)

for every derivation `D ∈ derivationLieQ = g₂`. Without these invariances one cannot even STATE
"the degree-≤4 g₂-invariants generated by δ and φ," so they are a REQUIRED step of the named ascent
(a toolkit brick, W1 step 1 / W9.8), NOT a lateral wander. This node banks exactly that toolkit; the
deep FFT count `dim (ImO^{⊗4})^{g₂} = 4 ⟹ tracelessSym irreducible` is childed as the dedicated
dissolution node it serves.

## The dissolution (why this is trunk-native, forced, and cheap)
Each invariance is FORCED by two banked facts, no coordinate grind:
  • δ:  `gFormQ_skew` (N24) — every derivation is skew-adjoint for the Born form — is LITERALLY the
    δ-invariance. (A derivation kills the self-conjugate `x·star y + y·star x`.)
  • φ:  the last two slots combine by the CROSS-PRODUCT Leibniz law `derivationLieQ_octCross_leibniz`
    (N207, `D (y×z) = (D y)×z + y×(D z)`) into `⟨x, D(y×z)⟩`; the whole is then
    `⟨D x, y×z⟩ + ⟨x, D(y×z)⟩ = 0` by δ-invariance (`gFormQ_skew`). One symmetry algebra fixing both
    faces of the exceptional structure (the product AND the cross product) — N207's "two faces."
  • ψ:  the associator `[x,y,z] = (x·y)·z − x·(y·z)` obeys the Leibniz rule (`assoc_deriv_leibniz`,
    it is built from products only); the first three slots combine into `⟨D[x,y,z], w⟩`, and the whole
    is `⟨D[x,y,z], w⟩ + ⟨[x,y,z], D w⟩ = 0` again by δ-invariance. ψ = *φ inherits its invariance from φ.

ONE CAUSE, MANY TERMINATIONS: the SAME Born self-overlap/positivity skew-adjointness (δ-invariance,
N24) that made every derivation live in `so(7)` also pins the g₂-invariance of the associative 3-form
φ and the coassociative 4-form ψ — the generators whose contractions the FFT count contracts to force
the 27 irreducible. The gather obstruction (octonion non-associativity, carried by φ) IS the object
