## STANDARD compliance (the words-removable test, §2)
NO physics words in any theorem STATEMENT. Delete every comment and the mathematics stands: over `ℚ`
and `O ℚ = CD (H ℚ)`, for every `D ∈ derivationLieQ` the bilinear `gForm`, the trilinear `assoc3`, and
the quadrilinear `coassoc4` satisfy the derivation/Leibniz invariance identity above. `gForm`, `assoc3`,
