field the statements are WRITTEN IN (the N24/N207/N209/N210 precedent). The TYPE of every headline
theorem mentions the banked tower objects (`gForm`/`assoc3`/`coassoc4`/`derivationLieQ`/`octCross`/`assoc`
on `O ℚ`) — no free-floating carrier-agnostic statement.

DERIVED from the trunk (`gFormQ_skew` N24; `derivationLieQ_octCross_leibniz`/`octCross_deriv_leibniz`
N207; `gForm_add_right`/`gForm_add_left` N24; `assoc3` N209; `coassoc4` N210; `assoc` N5b;
`derivationLieQ`/`IsDerivQ` N16–N21; `octCross` N206; standard additive-group MACHINERY on the DERIVED
